  "notes": "25 extract-content pages from https://pi.dev/docs/latest plus 7 raw GitHub files (root README/AGENTS/CONTRIBUTING, packages/agent, ai, tui READMEs, and packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md). extract-content output from pi.dev carries ~27% heading-anchor / search-widget chrome (anchors start with <a , so the shared sync-skill.sh filter does not drop them). Accept the chrome. Do not hand-strip committed docs. Do not edit the shared extract_content filter in this skill. discover-pages.sh crawls the HTML hub only (docs.json is a strict subset). Platform Setup slugs are denylisted. The sync-pi-on-release.yml workflow triggers on new GitHub releases. packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md is ~540KB (~2.5x the largest other committed skill doc); that size is expected, not a sync bug."
